"h303": "Install",
"h304": "Linux with Python 3.10 or newer, pip and git. The web UI starts on HTTPS port 8990 and a setup wizard asks for the Graylog connection.",
"h305": "Program: <code>/opt/jt-glogarch</code>, service <code>jt-glogarch</code>",
